WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Ryu counters the incoming corner attack with Drive Impact.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.300
Ryu's Drive Impact connects with a punish-counter crumple.

3
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.750
Ryu connects the back-heavy-punch follow-up at the corner.

4
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.400
Ryu strikes the cornered opponent with heavy High Blade Kick.

5
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.800
Ryu begins the medium Shoryuken juggle.

6
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.200
Ken falls beside Ryu after the corner juggle.
